# Enemy net: intercepted invader pilots. zealot (believer), merc (paid professional), conscript (frightened).

@enemy.spiked tactical
[zealot] That lead ship has me locked. It will not turn me from my duty.
[zealot] Missile on me from that marked tail. I am not afraid of him.
[zealot] He fires on me and I only fly straighter. Glory to the cause.
[zealot] Their ace thinks one shot ends me. He does not know our faith.
[zealot] Warning tone. So that defender is as good as they say. I will not break.
[zealot] I would sooner fall than run from that pilot. Still, I am turning.
[zealot] His missile is coming and I scorn it. Our cause is greater than any one man.
[zealot] That pilot fights for his land. I fight for something bigger. Evading.
[merc] Missile inbound from that ace. Dropping chaff, this is not worth it.
[merc] He shot first and he shot well. Defending, breaking off the engagement.
[merc] That defender knows his business. I am notching out of this one.
[merc] Spiked by the marked tail. Nobody pays me enough for a head-on with him.
[merc] Tone in my ears. I respect the shot, I will not stay for the next one.
[merc] That pilot is the real thing. Evading, and adding hazard pay to my bill.
[merc] Missile on me, and it is a good one. Their lead ship earns his reputation.
[merc] Not in the contract: the best defender on the island shooting at me.
[conscript] He has a missile on me! That pilot is coming for me, somebody help!
[conscript] Lead, I am spiked! The marked tail is shooting at me, what do I do?
[conscript] Missile, missile! Their ace picked me, I just want to go home!
[conscript] Please, somebody call him off! That lead ship has a lock on me!
[conscript] The warning will not stop! I did not think the defenders could shoot like that!
[conscript] I am defending, I am defending! Flight lead, where are you?
[conscript] It is that pilot everyone talks about, and he chose me! Help me!
[conscript] I am out of tricks, he has me! Mother, I should have stayed home.
[*] Missile warning, that lead ship has fired on me. Defending.
[*] Spiked by the marked tail. Breaking hard.
[*] Their ace has me locked up. Going defensive.
[*] Inbound missile, that defender means it. Notching.
[zealot night] Night is no cover for that defender, but I will not fear it.
[merc night] Spiked in the dark by their ace. Night work costs extra.
[merc rain] Rain, clutter, and the marked tail. Not what I signed up for.
[conscript night] I cannot see anything out here, and that pilot can see me!
[conscript rain] In this rain? He found me in this rain!

@enemy.fox tactical
[zealot] Fox three at that lead ship. Let him fall for his stubborn pride.
[zealot] Missile away at their ace. The cause will be avenged today.
[zealot] I fire on the marked tail. He cannot be the only brave one up here.
[zealot] Fox two at the lead defender. One shot, one legend ended.
[zealot] Launched on that pilot. They sing songs about him; let me end the song.
[zealot] Missile away. Their ace will learn what our faith can do.
[zealot] I take the shot on the marked tail. Duty demands it, and so does pride.
[zealot] Fox three at that fighter. It is an honor to be the one who ends him.
[merc] Missile away at their ace. Good luck to him, I am billing for that one.
[merc] Fox three on the lead ship. Do not expect much, he is hard to hit.
[merc] Shot out on the marked tail. Two missiles for him cost more than my day rate.
[merc] Launched at that pilot. Do the sums: a legend is worth a bonus.
[merc] Fox two, one for the ace. If it misses, I am heading for the exit.
[merc] Firing on the defender's lead. Pure business, nothing personal.
[merc] Missile away, long range, safe side. Let him sweat for it.
[merc] I fired at the marked tail. If he lives, it was not in the contract anyway.
[conscript] I fired! I fired at the lead ship, please let it hit him!
[conscript] Missile away at their ace! Please, someone cover me, he will fire back!
[conscript] Fox three, I think! That pilot is turning, is it going to hit him?
[conscript] I shot at the marked tail, I could not wait any longer. Why is he still flying?
[conscript] Launched on him. Everyone says he cannot be killed. Please let them be wrong.
[conscript] Missile gone at that defender! My hands are shaking so much.
[conscript] Fox two! Flight lead, did you see? I shot at their best pilot!
[conscript] I fired on the lead ship. Now I am scared he will come for me next.
