@enemy.matedown tactical
[zealot] <who> is down. That lead ship will pay for it, I swear.
[zealot] <who> fell with honor. I will avenge him on the marked tail.
[zealot] <who> is gone, but the cause is not. Where is that ace?
[zealot] <who> died for something greater than that defender knows.
[zealot] That pilot killed <who>. Fine, then he is mine now.
[zealot] They killed our brother! Mark that pilot, he will not leave this sky.
[zealot] I saw him burn. Their best pilot will answer for it.
[zealot] No tears for the fallen. Only vengeance on that lead ship.
[merc] <who> is down. That ace is not a defender, he is a problem.
[merc] Lost <who> to the marked tail. That is a debt I will not collect.
[merc] <who> is gone, and the lead ship does not even slow down.
